+<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"><meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy" content="default-src &#x27;none&#x27;; script-src &#x27;sha256-S+jHle/XaM/JOfSvhpMqFqEL347CTAu2+Ou3/jitrEk=&#x27;; style-src &#x27;self&#x27;; font-src &#x27;none&#x27;; connect-src &#x27;none&#x27;; form-action &#x27;none&#x27;; base-uri &#x27;none&#x27;; object-src &#x27;none&#x27;"><title>Daily essentials budget | Phuket Universe</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/phuket-daily-assets/budget.css" integrity="sha256-bsrnFXjKlRA7crDDdEtnv5CmqVesRUUzqMsoH1uVxvE="></head><body><a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to main content</a><header><a href="/en/phuket-universe/daily-essentials">Back to the daily planner</a><a lang="ru" href="/phuket-universe/daily-budget">Русский</a></header><main id="main" tabindex="-1"><h1>Daily essentials budget</h1><p>Allocate your own daily limit across six categories. These are your planned amounts, not Phuket market prices.</p><p id="units" class="muted">All amounts in THB. Enter 0 to 10,000,000 baht with up to two decimal places using a dot or comma, without thousands separators. Blank means unknown; 0 means no expense.</p><fieldset><legend>Expense plan</legend><div class="grid"><div class="field"><label for="budget">Daily limit</label><input id="budget" data-amount="" type="text" inputmode="decimal" autocomplete="off" maxlength="11" aria-describedby="units"></div><div class="field"><label for="food">Groceries and shopping</label><input id="food" data-amount="" type="text" inputmode="decimal" autocomplete="off" maxlength="11" aria-describedby="units"></div><div class="field"><label for="laundry">Laundry and household errands</label><input id="laundry" data-amount="" type="text" inputmode="decimal" autocomplete="off" maxlength="11" aria-describedby="units"></div><div class="field"><label for="work">Work and internet</label><input id="work" data-amount="" type="text" inputmode="decimal" autocomplete="off" maxlength="11" aria-describedby="units"></div><div class="field"><label for="transport">Transport</label><input id="transport" data-amount="" type="text" inputmode="decimal" autocomplete="off" maxlength="11" aria-describedby="units"></div><div class="field"><label for="services">Local services</label><input id="services" data-amount="" type="text" inputmode="decimal" autocomplete="off" maxlength="11" aria-describedby="units"></div><div class="field"><label for="leisure">Leisure and a walk</label><input id="leisure" data-amount="" type="text" inputmode="decimal" autocomplete="off" maxlength="11" aria-describedby="units"></div></div></fieldset><section id="results" hidden data-incomplete="Balance not calculated: fill the limit and all six categories." data-bad="Correct the invalid amounts." data-ok="The plan is within your limit." data-over="The plan exceeds your limit." aria-labelledby="results-title"><h2 id="results-title">Calculation</h2><div class="result" aria-live="polite"><div><span>Known expenses</span><output id="known">—</output></div><div><span>Categories without amounts</span><output id="unknown">—</output></div><div><span>Invalid fields</span><output id="invalid">—</output></div><div><span>Remaining limit</span><output id="remaining">—</output></div></div><p id="status" role="status"></p><button id="reset" type="button">Clear amounts</button></section><noscript><p>Without JavaScript, you can enter amounts; automatic calculation is unavailable.</p></noscript><p class="muted">The app does not send or store amounts. Your browser may restore values when you return. Do not enter personal information.</p></main><script src="/phuket-daily-assets/budget.js" integrity="sha256-S+jHle/XaM/JOfSvhpMqFqEL347CTAu2+Ou3/jitrEk="></script></body></html>
