" data-errand="" aria-labelledby="laundry-title" aria-describedby="laundry-help"><option value="0">Not selected</option><option value="1">Today</option><option value="2">Later</option><option value="3">Done</option></select></div><div class="item"><h3 id="work-title">Work and internet</h3><p id="work-help" class="muted">Check access hours, connectivity, power outlets and whether the space suits your work.</p><select id="work" data-errand="" aria-labelledby="work-title" aria-describedby="work-help"><option value="0">Not selected</option><option value="1">Today</option><option value="2">Later</option><option value="3">Done</option></select></div><div class="item"><h3 id="transport-title">Transport</h3><p id="transport-help" class="muted">Compare ways to get there and back; confirm availability and cost before leaving.</p><select id="transport" data-errand="" aria-labelledby="transport-title" aria-describedby="transport-help"><option value="0">Not selected</option><option value="1">Today</option><option value="2">Later</option><option value="3">Done</option></select></div><div class="item"><h3 id="services-title">Local services</h3><p id="services-help" class="muted">Check whether an appointment is needed, what to bring and the total price.</p><select id="services" data-errand="" aria-labelledby="services-title" aria-describedby="services-help"><option value="0">Not selected</option><option value="1">Today</option><option value="2">Later</option><option value="3">Done</option></select></div><div class="item"><h3 id="leisure-title">Leisure and a walk</h3><p id="leisure-help" class="muted">Choose a place and time; check current access conditions and weather.</p><select id="leisure" data-errand="" aria-labelledby="leisure-title" aria-describedby="leisure-help"><option value="0">Not selected</option><option value="1">Today</option><option value="2">Later</option><option value="3">Done</option></select></div></div></fieldset><section class="plan" id="plan" hidden data-empty="Nothing selected yet."><h2 id="plan-title">Your plan</h2><ul class="counts" aria-live="polite"><li><span data-count-label="">Today</span>: <output data-count="1">0</output></li><li><span data-count-label="">Later</span>: <output data-count="2">0</output></li><li><span data-count-label="">Done</span>: <output data-count="3">0</output></li></ul><textarea id="plan-text" readonly aria-labelledby="plan-title"></textarea><button id="reset" type="button">Reset choices</button></section><noscript><p>Without JavaScript, mark errands manually; counters and the text plan are unavailable.</p></noscript><p class="muted">Select and copy the plan manually if useful. The app does not store or send your choices. Your browser may restore them when you return. Do not enter personal information.</p></main><script src="/phuket-daily-assets/essentials.js" integrity="sha256-X290t2aVRokOwj+RGOnU5RDbjS23mbuZiA1AHsAHwhY="></script></body></html>
